OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced over 'horrific'
OL,4,Aattempted murder of three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the circumstances were uniquely
OL,7,Fhorrific and marked a profound assault
OL,8,Fon the most fundamental values
OL,9,Fprotected by the criminal law.
